---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---
<AppLayout title="Terms of Service – NearSpot">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: June 2025</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        By accessing or using NearSpot, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If
        you do not agree, please do not use the platform.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">2. Use of the Platform</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-600 space-y-1">
        <li>You must be at least 18 years old to use NearSpot.</li>
        <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account credentials.</li>
        <li>You agree not to misuse the platform, including spamming vendors or submitting false information.</li>
        <li>Vendors are responsible for the accuracy of their product and service listings.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">3. Reservations and Payments</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        NearSpot facilitates reservations between customers and vendors. Payment transactions
        are processed by a third-party payment provider. NearSpot is not liable for vendor
        fulfilment of reservations; disputes should be raised through our support channel.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">4. Loyalty Points</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        Loyalty points are earned and redeemed on the NearSpot platform. Points have no
        cash value and may not be transferred or sold. NearSpot reserves the right to
        modify the loyalty programme at any time with reasonable notice.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">5. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-600 space-y-1">
        <li>Posting false, misleading, or fraudulent listings</li>
        <li>Harassing, threatening, or abusing other users or vendors</li>
        <li>Attempting to circumvent platform fees or payment systems</li>
        <li>Using automated bots or scrapers on the platform</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        NearSpot is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for
        indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the platform.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        For questions about these terms, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:legal@nearspot.in" class="text-navy underline">legal@nearspot.in</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppLayout>
